<title>USA: Scangraphics says names Osterwise CEO.</title>
<headline>Scangraphics says names Osterwise CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BROOMALL, Pa. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scangraphics Inc said Tuesday its board of directors elected Laurence Osterwise to the position of president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He was also elected to the board of directors. As announced last October, Osterwise was to succeed as chief executive officer, thereby replacing Andrew E. Trolio, after an appropriate transition period. Trolio will remain with the company as chairman of the board.</p>
</text>
